e model, God. The MANY side model would be Human. Each God could have MANY Humans following him/her through a JOIN model of GuardianAngel. The God model could have many GuardianAngels but lets say s/he doesn\u2019t care about keeping track of all his/her follower Humans. Who said DB associations were boring?","topics":[],"score":182667,"global_rank":405044}]